type: dataset
title: "Agent-Readiness of 50 Cross-Border DTC Brands (2026)"
abstract: "Audit of machine-readable agent-readiness signals (UCP manifest, agent-payments endpoint, MCP endpoint, llms.txt, robots.txt AI-crawler directives, schema.org Product) on the owned storefronts of 50 Chinese-origin cross-border DTC brands with US-facing storefronts (47 reachable). 25 of 25 UCP manifests found at collection (2026-08) were Shopify-issued: 22 confirmed live by the powered-by response header on 2026-08-21, 3 (Anker, Soundcore, eufy) no longer served and attributed by a collection-time *.myshopify.com host hint."
